### ============================================================
### BANK MANAGEMENT - SEED DATA
### Run these requests in order using REST Client (VS Code)
### or paste into Postman / curl
### ============================================================

### 1. Register ADMIN user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123",
  "role": "ADMIN",
  "customerId": null
}

###

### 2. Login as ADMIN (copy the token for requests below)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###
### ---- Paste your token below replacing <TOKEN> ----

### 3. Create Customer 1 - Rahul Sharma
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@email.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "address": "12 Anna Nagar, Chennai, Tamil Nadu"
}

###

### 4. Create Customer 2 - Priya Venkat
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "name": "Priya Venkat",
  "email": "priya.venkat@email.com",
  "phone": "9123456780",
  "address": "45 Gandhipuram, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu"
}

###

### 5. Create Customer 3 - Arjun Mehta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "name": "Arjun Mehta",
  "email": "arjun.mehta@email.com",
  "phone": "9988776655",
  "address": "78 RS Puram, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu"
}

###
### ---- After creating customers, note the customerId from each response ----
### Assuming: Rahul=1, Priya=2, Arjun=3

### 6. Create Account for Rahul (customerId: 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "accountNumber": "SB-1001-2024",
  "accountType": "SAVINGS",
  "balance": 50000.00,
  "customerId": 1
}

###

### 7. Create Account for Priya (customerId: 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "accountNumber": "SB-1002-2024",
  "accountType": "CURRENT",
  "balance": 125000.00,
  "customerId": 2
}

###

### 8. Create Account for Arjun (customerId: 3)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "accountNumber": "FD-1003-2024",
  "accountType": "FIXED_DEPOSIT",
  "balance": 200000.00,
  "customerId": 3
}

###

### 9. Register login user for Rahul (customerId: 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "rahul",
  "password": "Rahul@123",
  "role": "CUSTOMER",
  "customerId": 1
}

###

### 10. Register login user for Priya (customerId: 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "priya",
  "password": "Priya@123",
  "role": "CUSTOMER",
  "customerId": 2
}

###

### 11. Register login user for Arjun (customerId: 3)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "arjun",
  "password": "Arjun@123",
  "role": "CUSTOMER",
